  m_Name: Magmatic Terrorwyrm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fishName: Magmatic Terrorwyrm
  description: Possibly the most dangerous creature across all four planets in the
    system, terrorwyrms are peerless hunters both on land and in the magma-flows
    of Firax. A wise hunter waits until it has taken a dip in the lava to draw it
    out.\n\n  Chef's Notes:\nWell worth the trouble! Like most predators, its meat
    is naturally tough, but after a long slow-cook, garnished with fireweed and powdered
    Magma Crab shell, a Terrorwyrm roast is one of the best crowd-pleasers around!
